== Notes ==

At level 35 you will earn half a yellow bubble of exp for turning in 40 [[Crushbone Shoulderpads]] (20 turn ins).

Level 7 gnome wizard went from 0% in 7 to nearly 60% into 8 with 15 turn ins, 30 pads.  Roughly 10% per turn in.


